   • PA,ω ∀i ∈ [r], |Vfη (A, ω) ∩ Vi | ≥ ki ≥ 1 − δ,

where V1 , . . . , Vr are the vertex partitions of the r-partite hypergraph H(r, n, p).

   Here, k1 , . . . , kr are the desired sizes of the intersections of the independent set with each
partition, while the other parameters are the same as in Definition 1.2. We note that for balanced
independent sets, we would have k1 = · · · = kr , however, as we will see in the next section, we
consider the more general γ-balanced independent sets in which we allow different values of ki .

